</p></div><a class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between rounded-full outline-hidden disabled:cursor-not-allowed motion-safe:transition-[background-color,color,border-radius] focus-button bg-surface-primary-500 text-white hover:bg-surface-primary-300 focus-visible:bg-surface-primary-300 active:bg-green-350 disabled:bg-surface-disabled h-10 gap-1 px-4 text-label-md flex-row-reverse mt-4 place-self-start md:mt-6" href="/blog/outcomemaxxing">Read more</a></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-white theme-tech:bg-black theme-tech:text-gray-100 theme-product:bg-gray-100 theme-platform:bg-gray-200 theme-brand:bg-green-800 theme-brand:text-white relative py-section-padding overflow-x-hidden" style="z-index:1"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1160px] px-container-margin"><div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-grid-gutter gap-y-3 px-4 md:gap-y-4 md:px-0 xl:gap-y-6 pb-12 md:pb-20 xl:pb-8"><h2 class="whitespace-pre-wrap text-black theme-tech:text-white text-headline-lg col-span-12 xl:col-span-8">Related products</h2></div><section aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Carousel"><div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-6"><div class="cursor-move"><div class="flex gap-grid-gutter" id="_R_2ldbsnqbtb_" aria-live="polite"><div class="relative min-w-0 flex-[0_0_100%] select-none" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="1 of 0"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 right-0 bottom-0 left-0 z-20 bg-white/0 transition-colors"></div><div class="flex h-full flex-col items-start gap-6 rounded-3xl p-4 md:p-6 xl:justify-center xl:gap-12 theme-tech bg-green-800 xl:flex-row"><figure class="relative aspect-square w-full max-w-[350px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl"><div class="wistia-bg overflow-hidden bg-surface-tertiary-100 absolute inset-0" style="contain:layout paint"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:10